WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:02,100
That's the case

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,140
Don't worry, do it

3
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:05,340
Your Majesty, leave it to me later

4
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:08,460
But 30% is not enough, I want 60%

5
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,580
60% or so is good

6
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,780
I will take you to give this 60% to the court

7
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,740
Only in this way can we better persuade the emperor and the prince

8
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,260
This share is not my own

9
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:18,300
Clear out Cao Bang this time

10
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:20,380
Both Lu Guogong's Mansion and Qian Guogong's Mansion have people.

11
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:21,380
And give them shares

12
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:22,300
That's fifty percent

13
00:00:22,380 --> 00:00:23,860
I will also tell the two princes

14
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,460
Let them take 1.40% less

15
00:00:25,700 --> 00:00:26,740
And it’s for you personally

16
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:27,980
Such a big flow of water

17
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,900
The imperial court can also collect a lot of taxes.

18
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:31,220
you are young

19
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:32,340
What do you need so much money for?

20
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,940
Your father’s phoenix dew is enough for you to spend

21
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,020
Get married and have children in the future

22
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:36,180
You can't just rely on my dad

23
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,900
What a meager income. Besides,

24
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:39,220
Brother Chu Yue has 10% of this

25
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,060
You two, father and son, are enough. He also has it.

26
00:00:41,060 --> 00:00:42,580
When talking about Cao Bang, Brother Chu Yue also came out.

27
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:45,140
Naturally, with his shares, that would be 40%.

28
00:00:45,140 --> 00:00:47,900
Don't worry, how long will it take for Cao Yun to recover?

29
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:48,900
three days later

30
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,900
Cao Yun will definitely return to normal operation
